Program No. 4: Rocket-Launching Countdown (manual page 27)
(Launch to occur when computer output generates 000)

ADDRESS  CONTENTS  COMMENTS
  00      +001     Data.
  19      -004     Data.
  20       119     -004 to accumulator.
  21       200     Add 001.
  22       618     Store accum. in cell 18.
  23       518     Print contents of cell 18.
  24       321     Test acc. { If minus, jump to cell 21.
                             { If plus, go ahead to cell 25.
  25       900     Halt and reset.
